msgid "**Tier 2 translation engines** are maintained and supported by the community.  \nWhen these engines encounter issues, the project maintainers will not provide direct fixes. Instead, they will label the related issues with `help wanted` and welcome pull requests from contributors to help resolve them.\n\nAll engines that are supported by the program but not explicitly listed under Tier 1 are considered Tier 2 translation engines.\n"
msgstr "- #### Tier 2 (Community Support): - [Immersive Translate](https://immersivetranslate.com/) - Browser extension\n- [BilingualPDF](https://github.com/mahdihasheminezhad/BilingualPDF) - A wrapper around `pdf2zh` for better math translation\n\n---\n\n### OUTPUT\n\n**Tier 2 翻訳エンジン**はコミュニティによってメンテナンスおよびサポートされています。  \nこれらのエンジンに問題が発生した場合、プロジェクトメンテナーは直接修正を提供せず、関連する issue に `help wanted` ラベルを付けて、貢献者からのプルリクエストによる解決を歓迎します。\n\nプログラムでサポートされているが Tier 1 に明示的にリストされていないすべてのエンジンは、Tier 2 翻訳エンジンと見なされます。\n- #### Tier 2 (コミュニティサポート)\n- [Immersive Translate](https://immersivetranslate.com/) - ブラウザ拡張機能\n- [BilingualPDF](https://github.com/mahdihasheminezhad/BilingualPDF) - `pdf2zh` をラップして数式翻訳を強化したツール\n- #### Deprecated Engines: - [!WARNING]\n- The following engines are deprecated and will be removed in future versions.\n\n##### Google Translate\n- Google Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `google` engine instead.\n\n##### Google Translate RPC\n- Google Translate RPC is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `google` engine instead.\n\n##### Google Translate Web\n- Google Translate Web is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `google` engine instead.\n\n##### Microsoft Translator\n- Microsoft Translator is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `microsoft` engine instead.\n\n##### Yandex Translate\n- Yandex Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `yandex` engine instead.\n\n##### LibreTranslate\n- LibreTranslate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `libretranslate` engine instead.\n\n##### Argos Translate\n- Argos Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `argos` engine instead.\n\n##### MyMemory\n- MyMemory is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `mymemory` engine instead.\n\n##### Baidu Translate\n- Baidu Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `baidu` engine instead.\n\n##### Youdao Translate\n- Youdao Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `youdao` engine instead.\n\n##### Alibaba Translate\n- Alibaba Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `alibaba` engine instead.\n\n##### Tencent Translate\n- Tencent Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `tencent` engine instead.\n\n##### Volcengine Translate\n- Volcengine Translate is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `volcengine` engine instead.\n\n##### Niutrans\n- Niutrans is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `niutrans` engine instead.\n\n##### Papago\n- Papago is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `papago` engine instead.\n\n##### Deepl\n- Deepl is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `deepl` engine instead.\n\n##### OpenAI\n- OpenAI is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `openai` engine instead.\n\n##### Gemini\n- Gemini is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `gemini` engine instead.\n\n##### Ollama\n- Ollama is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `ollama` engine instead.\n\n##### Groq\n- Groq is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `groq` engine instead.\n\n##### Anthropic\n- Anthropic is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `anthropic` engine instead.\n\n##### Cohere\n- Cohere is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `cohere` engine instead.\n\n##### Mistral\n- Mistral is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `mistral` engine instead.\n\n##### Perplexity\n- Perplexity is deprecated and will be removed in future versions. Please use the `perplexity` engine inst