# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 1
msgctxt "chunk_D0E62F41"
msgid "# Suggesting Improvements to the Documentation Translations\n"
msgstr "# ドキュメント翻訳の改善提案\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 3
msgctxt "chunk_5E99F395"
msgid "Thank you for your interest in this project! The non‑English documentation is automatically translated by large language models, so mistakes are inevitable. If you notice issues in a language you are familiar with, we warmly welcome your suggestions for improvement.\n\nBefore you start contributing, please take a moment to read the following guide to help ensure your suggestions can be smoothly accepted.\n"
msgstr "このプロジェクトに興味を持っていただきありがとうございます！英語以外のドキュメントは大規模言語モデルによって自動翻訳されているため、誤りが避けられません。もしあなたが熟知している言語で問題を発見した場合、改善提案を心から歓迎します。\n\n貢献を始める前に、あなたの提案がスムーズに受け入れられるよう、以下のガイドを一読してください。\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 7
msgctxt "chunk_B08C64DE"
msgid "# Submit Suggestions via Weblate\n"
msgstr "# Weblate 経由で提案を提出\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 9
msgctxt "chunk_66E75B28"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 11
msgctxt "chunk_800CE400"
msgid "## How to submit a suggestion\n"
msgstr "## 提案の提出方法\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 13
msgctxt "chunk_B3B32731"
msgid "It's very simple to propose translation improvements via Weblate, and you don't even need to register an account. Read on for the step-by-step process.\n\nAssume you want to improve the first sentence in the \"Command-line arguments\" section of [Advanced → Advanced](docs/en/advanced/advanced.md):\n"
msgstr "Weblate を介して翻訳の改善を提案するのは非常に簡単で、アカウント登録すら必要ありません。以下の手順をご覧ください。\n\n[高级选项 → 高级](docs/en/advanced/advanced.md) の「命令行参数」セクションの最初の文を改善したいと仮定します：\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 17
msgctxt "chunk_3B565B8D"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 23
msgctxt "chunk_961D5AD9"
msgid "3. In \"Filter\", enter the text segment you want to find. Partial text is fine.\n"
msgstr "3. 「Filter」に、検索したいテキストセグメントを入力します。部分的なテキストでも構いません。\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 27
msgctxt "chunk_7F95E46F"
msgid "When you're done, press <kbd>Enter</kbd>.\n"
msgstr "完了したら、<kbd>Enter</kbd> を押してください。\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 29
msgctxt "chunk_49D0E074"
msgid "4. After pressing <kbd>Enter</kbd>, you'll be taken to the search results page. Click the result you prefer to open the edit view.\n"
msgstr "4. <kbd>Enter</kbd> キーを押すと、検索結果ページに移動します。希望する結果をクリックして編集ビューを開きます。\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 33
msgctxt "chunk_89F91031"
msgid "5. In the edit view, make your changes to the translation. When finished, click <kbd>Suggest</kbd>. That's it—you've successfully completed a contribution.\n"
msgstr "5. 編集ビューで、翻訳に変更を加えます。完了したら、<kbd>提案</kbd>をクリックします。これで完了です。無事に貢献を完了しました。\n"

# This content is from "Translate-Contribution-Guide.md", line 37
msgctxt "chunk_998E5059"
msgid "We will review your suggestion after it's submitted. Once approved, your changes will appear in the documentation."
msgstr "提案が提出された後、私たちがレビューを行います。承認されると、変更がドキュメントに反映されます。"

